                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "petroleum_substance",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "Companies extract <w>bitumen</w> from the oil sands and upgrade it into synthetic crude."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Transporting untreated <w>bitumen</w> through pipelines requires blending it with lighter hydrocarbons."
